Package: px4-userland
Name: PX4 Driver
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Section: Utilities
Priority: optional
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Depends: libusb-1.0-0
Recommends: pcscd
Maintainer: Khronos31 <39792509+Khronos31@users.noreply.github.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/Khronos31/px4-userland
Tag: purpose::console
Description: Userland PX-Q3U4 tuner and card driver
 Owns a PLEX PX-Q3U4 (USB ID 0511:084a) from userspace via libusb:
 eight tuners plus the built-in IC card reader. Binaries are px4d,
 px4-ts, px4ctl, and px4-usb-probe. Built on-device for rootless jailbreaks.
 .
 IT930x firmware is not included. Place the 2169-byte blob at
 /var/jb/usr/share/px4-userland/it930x-firmware.bin (SHA-256
 5213a5a38872661277a2cc1b2dfdfe88faf06f41205f460f3b51857f0568b484)
 or pass --firmware PATH. PATH wrappers default --runtime-dir to
 $HOME/.px4-userland (mode 0700). px4-usb-probe lists the
 Q3U4 serial with the same IOKit USB entitlements as px4d.
 .
 Ships libpx4-userland-ifd.dylib for pcscd (dlopen). Register with
 px4-pcsc-register BASE_SERIAL RUNTIME_DIR; run px4d as the same
 user as pcscd (root on launchd).
 .
 Signed with IOKit USB entitlements (same set as Siano Driver).
 GPL-2.0-only.
